{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Pink Cake is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". It can also be received as a gift at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"]," or may randomly appear in ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环#Saturday","Saturdays"]," or in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],"'s rotating stock. It can also randomly be found in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside the saloon. Five Pink Cakes can be purchased from ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 20 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s. One Pink Cake may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],". If the player's character is male, after he earns 120,000g he will receive a ",["l","妈妈和爸爸","letter from mom"]," with a Pink Cake enclosed."]],["p",["3 Pink Cakes are the reward for completing the Bulletin Board. Pink cake is also sometimes contained within ",["l","史莱姆#Big Slimes","Big Slimes"]," (0.1% chance). Killing the big slime will result in a receiving a Pink Cake, or two if the player has a ",["l","窃贼戒指","Burglar's Ring"]," equipped."]],["p",["The ",["l","无尽财富之雕像","Statue Of Endless Fortune"]," produces three Pink Cakes per year, on the birthdays of ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", and ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],"."]],["p",["Note: this recipe is ",["l","烹饪#Profitable Recipes","profitable"]," - it will always result in profit if using the lowest quality ingredients as well as ",["l","大麦粉","Wheat Flour"]," and ",["l","糖","Sugar"]," from the ",["l","磨坊","Mill"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Pink Cake is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Pink Cake is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Pink Cake is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create a ",["l","裁缝","Shirt"],". ",["f","Shirt051.png",24]," It can also be used in the dye pots to fill the red pot, found in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Pink Cake is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". ",["l","哈维","Harvey"]," now dislikes it as a gift."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be prepared using a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Now obtainable during ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]]]]]]]}